Server Information Disclosure
Scenario

Server Information Disclosure

Description

The website shows server details like Apache, Nginx, IIS, PHP version, etc.

Test Steps
Open the website.
Right click → Inspect → Network tab.
Reload the page.
Check response headers.
Look for:
Server
X-Powered-By
Expected Issue

Server name/version is visible.

Risk

Hackers can identify server technology and attack known vulnerabilities.

Mitigation
Hide server details.
Remove unnecessary response headers.
Tools Can Be Used
Burp Suite
Browser DevTools
curl
Severity

Medium
